      "questionID": "673c8a427d4345fd873f8b3a",
      "userSolution": "def find_pairs(nums, target):\r\n    seen = set()\r\n    pairs = set()\r\n\r\n    for num in nums:\r\n        complement = target - num\r\n        if complement in seen:\r\n            pairs.add(tuple(sorted((num, complement))))\r\n        seen.add(num)\r\n\r\n    # Convert set of tuples to sorted list of lists\r\n    return sorted([list(pair) for pair in pairs])\r\n",
